## 4. Redirections Tests

### Output Redirection (>)
```bash
echo hello > test.txt
cat test.txt
ls > files.txt
cat files.txt
echo "overwrite" > test.txt
cat test.txt
```

### Append Redirection (>>)
```bash
echo hello > test.txt
echo world >> test.txt
cat test.txt
ls >> files.txt
cat files.txt
```

### Input Redirection (<)
```bash
echo "hello world" > input.txt
cat < input.txt
wc -w < input.txt
head -1 < /etc/passwd
```

### Here Document (<<)
```bash
cat << EOF
hello
world
EOF

cat << DELIM
line 1
line 2
DELIM

wc -l << END
line 1
line 2
line 3
END
```

### Multiple Redirections
```bash
echo hello > out.txt 2> err.txt
cat < input.txt > output.txt
echo test > file1.txt > file2.txt
```

### Redirection with Pipes
```bash
echo hello | cat > output.txt
ls | head -3 > files.txt
cat < input.txt | wc -l > count.txt
```

